      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Is \"from\" capitalized because of consistency? RFC 7322 section 3.4 recommends not to capitalize prepositions.\n\nThere\u0027s some nuance for this kind of thing I think [1]. I looked at the APA style guide first and it recommended: *Capitalize all words of four letters or more*.\n\nLet me look at some of the other guides mentioned on wikipedia.\n\n[1] https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Title_case",
